  "text": " \n \n \n \n Audubon County \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nHome \n \nBusiness Directory \n \nCalendar \n \nWhat's New \n \nContact ACED \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nCities \n \nCounty Information \n \nExplore Audubon County \n \nEconomic Development \n \nCalendar \n \n \nBusiness Directory \n \nCalendar \n \nContact ACED \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \nWhere Dreams\n \n\n \nTake Flight\n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nover 21 miles for cyclist, walkers, and families to enjoy! \n \n \n \n \n \nScott Ross Audubon County Print \n \n \n \n \n \nKayaking \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nBird mosaics, John James Audubon \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nDanish Countryside Vines and Wines \n \n \n \n \n \nAlbert - The World's Largest Bull \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n \n \n\n \n\n Welcome to Audubon County\n\nAudubon County has a long history with agriculture and sense of community. Audubon County is located in south west Iowa with a population of approximately 5,674 residents. Named for the naturalist and artist John James Audubon, Audubon County consists of five incorporated towns; Audubon, Brayton, Exira, Gray and Kimballton. Audubon County welcomes you to come explore!\nAudubon County offers tremendous opportunities for new business and business expansion through its availability of space, strong workforce and support services\n\n\nCOUNFARMad 2026-2028 Crop Year\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \nUPCOMING EVENTS \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct17 \n \n \n \n Tree Planting & Trail Clean Up\n \n Exira\n \n 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct20 \n \n \n \n What's Happening With... Fall 2026\n \n Audubon\n \n 10:00 AM - 10:45 AM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct27 \n \n \n \n What's Happening With... Fall 2026\n \n Audubon\n \n 10:00 AM - 10:45 AM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct27 \n \n \n \n Bingo at ARC 10.27\n \n Audubon\n \n 6:00 PM - 10:00 PM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct30 \n \n \n \n Halloween at the REC 2026\n \n Audubon\n \n 11:00 AM - 10:00 PM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct31 \n \n \n \n Hunter's Breakfast 2026\n \n Audubon\n \n 7:00 AM - 9:30 AM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct31 \n \n \n \n Meet Iowa Author & Book Release\n \n Audubon\n \n 10:00 AM - 11:00 AM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Oct31 \n \n \n \n Annual Rooster Tail Hunt 26\n \n Kimballton\n \n 11:00 AM - 5:00 PM \n \n \n \n \n \n \n> View Calendar \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nHome \n \nEconomic Development \n \nExplore Audubon County \n \nCounty Information \n \nCities \n \nBusiness Directory \n \nCalendar \n \nWhat's New \n \nEmergency Management \n \nContact ACED \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nCopyright 2026 Audubon County \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n"
